What I CAN Claim:

I can identify observational statistical correlations, grouped trends, and pattern associations between specific content signals and page visibility/clicks within this dataset.

What I CAN'T Claim:

I cannot claim causation or prove that a specific signal is a direct Google search ranking factor. The results are strictly observational, and correlation does not imply causation. Furthermore, I will not treat synthetic metrics (like health_score) as both a feature and a target.
